.env
.env.*

# NOTE: tests/ and scripts/ are deliberately NOT listed here even though
# design D19 says the production runtime must never contain them. The
# `dev` build target and the `builder` stage (Dockerfile) explicitly
# `COPY tests ./tests` and `COPY scripts ./scripts` -- .dockerignore
# filters the build context once, for every stage, so ignoring these
# directories here would break those COPYs (verified: Docker refuses to
# COPY a dockerignored path even when the instruction names it directly).
# The `prod` stage's COPY allowlist (app/, migrations/, alembic.ini only)
# is therefore the actual, sole mechanism that keeps tests/ and scripts/
# out of the production image -- this file is a blocklist for paths no
# stage ever needs, not a substitute for that allowlist.
